  "description": {
   "en": "Reginald Guevarra, a 4th year college student felt like his life is stuck on repeat.\nEvery day is the same schoolwork, research, thesis, exams, and more. He misses the fun and excitement of his senior high school days, where everything felt exciting for him.\n\nOne day, he gets a strange text with a QR code and a location. Curious, he decides to go  and on the way, he meets a familiar face from the past. But what waits at the end of the road is more than just a reunion.\n\nAll his old classmates are there, and they’ve been forced in a massive game venue. To escape, they’ll have to play  and win.\n\nFriendships will be tested, memories would be a weapon, secrets will be revealed, and there’s no guarantee everyone will make it out."
  },
